            "value": "Wolfand, J. M., Seller, C., Bell, C. D., Cho, Y. M., Oetjen, K., Hogue, T. S., & Luthy, R. G. (2019). Occurrence of Urban-Use Pesticides and Management with Enhanced Stormwater Control Measures at the Watershed Scale. Environmental Science & Technology, 53(7), 3634-3644. http://doi.org/10.1021/acs.est.8b05833",
